The code in question is the `adjust_plines_for_skipcol` function:

```c
int adjust_plines_for_skipcol(win_T *wp)
{
    if (wp->w_skipcol == 0)
        return 0;
    int width = wp->w_width - win_col_off(wp);
    int w2 = width + win_col_off2(wp);
